• The key day-to-day contact for the client &amp; their agencies across Moving Image projects (inclusive of broadcast, digital and social production)&nbsp; &nbsp;

• Own regular status updates and communications with clients &nbsp;

• Define scope and approach, setting and managing expectations &nbsp;

• Understand client’s needs to&nbsp;maintain&nbsp;high satisfaction levels    &nbsp;

• Ensure awareness of timelines and deliverables on projects   &nbsp;

• Ensure a clear understanding of the production brief,&nbsp;deliverables&nbsp;and timeline for each project   &nbsp;

Collaboration   &nbsp;

• Demonstrate strong collaboration skills with internal agency teams and key external partners to ensure quality and adherence to production guidelines&nbsp; &nbsp;

Process   &nbsp;

